        "strokeWidth": 2.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-a",
      "type": "markdown",
      "x": -2000.0,
      "y": -650.0,
      "width": 440.0,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "rotation": 0.0,
      "content": "**THE CULTURAL MANDATE**\n### God made culture-making part of our job\n- Made in God's image (Gen 1:26–27)\n- \"Fill the earth and subdue it\" (Gen 1:28)\n- **Cultural mandate**: God's call to develop his world, repeated through redemptive history",
      "textStyle": {
        "size": 17.0,
        "weight": 400.0,
        "color": "#2b2116",
        "lineHeight": 1.38,
        "letterSpacing": 0.0,
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-b-card",
      "type": "shape",
      "x": -1440.0,
      "y": -650.0,
      "width": 500.0,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "rotation": 0.0,
      "content": "",
      "shapeData": {
        "kind": "rectangle",
        "fill": "#f7edcf",
        "stroke": "#b89b68",
        "strokeWidth": 2.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-b",
      "type": "markdown",
      "x": -1440.0,
      "y": -650.0,
      "width": 440.0,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "rotation": 0.0,
      "content": "**EVERY AREA OF LIFE**\n### Every Christian is a \"culture guy\"\nCultural apologetics isn't a fascination with music and the arts. It's defending and commending the faith in **every area of life**.",
      "textStyle": {
        "size": 17.0,
        "weight": 400.0,
        "color": "#2b2116",
        "lineHeight": 1.38,
        "letterSpacing": 0.0,
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-ex-card",
      "type": "shape",
      "x": -920.0,
      "y": -650.0,
      "width": 500.0,
      "scale": 1.0,
