      "x": -920.0,
      "y": -650.0,
      "width": 440.0,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "rotation": 0.0,
      "content": "**EXERCISE**\n### Your week in culture\n1. List 5 things you did this week.\n2. Next to each, name the culture in it (work, food, screens, school, church…).\n3. Circle one your faith *should* shape.",
