      "y": 0.0,
      "width": 420.0,
      "scale": 1.8,
      "rotation": 0.0,
      "content": "## II. Fall\n### Our moment says \"I am\"\n*Why does culture press on us now?*",
      "textStyle": {
        "size": 17.0,
        "weight": 400.0,
        "color": "#2b2116",
        "lineHeight": 1.38,
        "letterSpacing": 0.0,
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2-a-card",
      "type": "shape",
      "x": 400.0,
      "y": 0.0,
      "width": 500.0,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "rotation": 0.0,
      "content": "",
      "shapeData": {
        "kind": "rectangle",
        "fill": "#f7edcf",
        "stroke": "#b89b68",
        "strokeWidth": 2.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2-a",
      "type": "markdown",
      "x": 400.0,
      "y": 0.0,
      "width": 440.0,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "rotation": 0.0,
      "content": "**WHY NOW**\n### Culture has forced itself upon us\n- Since COVID, a surge in homeschooling\n- Parents saw what was \"in the can\" didn't match the label\n- And reacted to new ideology on sex and gender (\"wokeism\") in schools",
      "textStyle": {
        "size": 17.0,
        "weight": 400.0,
        "color": "#2b2116",
        "lineHeight": 1.38,
        "letterSpacing": 0.0,
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2-b-card",
      "type": "shape",
      "x": 960.0,
      "y": 0.0,
      "width": 500.0,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "rotation": 0.0,
      "content": "",
      "shapeData": {
        "kind": "rectangle",
        "fill": "#f7edcf",
        "stroke": "#b89b68",
        "strokeWidth": 2.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2-b",
      "type": "markdown",
      "x": 960.0,
      "y": 0.0,
      "width": 440.0,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "rotation": 0.0,
      "content": "**THE PSYCHOLOGICAL SELF**\n### Our culture crowns self-expression as the highest good\nCarl Trueman: who I feel I am inside is who I really am, and everyone must affirm it.",
      "textStyle": {
        "size": 17.0,
        "weight": 400.0,
        "color": "#2b2116",
        "lineHeight": 1.38,
        "letterSpacing": 0.0,
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2-c-card",
      "type": "shape",
      "x": 1520.0,
      "y": 0.0,
      "width": 500.0,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "rotation": 0.0,
      "content": "",
      "shapeData": {
        "kind": "rectangle",
        "fill": "#f7edcf",
        "stroke": "#b89b68",
        "strokeWidth": 2.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2-c",
      "type": "markdown",
      "x": 1520.0,
      "y": 0.0,
      "width": 440.0,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "rotation": 0.0,
      "content": "**THE OLDEST SIN**\n### Autonomy is the heart of sin\n- **Autonomy** = *auto* (self) + *nomos* (law): being a law to yourself\n- Sin is lawlessness (1 John 3:4)\n- Only God says \"I am\" (Exod 3:14; Isa 45:5)",
      "textStyle": {
        "size": 17.0,
        "weight": 400.0,
        "color": "#2b2116",
        "lineHeight": 1.38,
        "letterSpacing": 0.0,
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2-d",
      "type": "markdown",
      "x": 1520.0,
      "y": 245.0,
      "width": 420.0,
      "scale": 0.45,
      "rotation": 0.0,
      "content": "### God names himself\n\"We don't name God; God names himself\" (Bavinck). Theology begins because God has spoken. We think his thoughts after him, in obedient repetition.",
      "textStyle": {
        "size": 17.0,
        "weight": 400.0,
        "color": "#2b2116",
        "lineHeight": 1.38,
        "letterSpacing": 0.0,
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
