      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3-ex",
      "type": "markdown",
      "x": -920.0,
      "y": 650.0,
      "width": 440.0,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "rotation": 0.0,
      "content": "**EXERCISE**\n### Plunder or poison?\nPick a current trend, slogan or ad.\n1. **Receive**: what true insight does it borrow from God's world?\n2. **Reject**: what root claim opposes God?",
      "textStyle": {
        "size": 17.0,
        "weight": 400.0,
        "color": "#2b2116",
        "lineHeight": 1.38,
        "letterSpacing": 0.0,
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
