      "y": 650.0,
      "width": 420.0,
      "scale": 1.8,
      "rotation": 0.0,
      "content": "## IV. Our place\n### Engage your culture humbly\n*What spirit should drive us?*",
      "textStyle": {
        "size": 17.0,
        "weight": 400.0,
        "color": "#2b2116",
        "lineHeight": 1.38,
        "letterSpacing": 0.0,
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-a-card",
      "type": "shape",
      "x": 400.0,
      "y": 1150.0,
      "width": 500.0,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "rotation": 0.0,
      "content": "",
      "shapeData": {
        "kind": "rectangle",
        "fill": "#f7edcf",
        "stroke": "#b89b68",
        "strokeWidth": 2.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-a",
      "type": "markdown",
      "x": 400.0,
      "y": 1150.0,
      "width": 440.0,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "rotation": 0.0,
      "content": "**SELF-AWARENESS**\n### See your culture as a culture\n- Global contact makes cultural self-awareness essential\n- Your culture \"packages\" the questions you face\n- \"I am American (or Brazilian, Chinese…), but I am **first** a Christian\"",
      "textStyle": {
        "size": 17.0,
        "weight": 400.0,
        "color": "#2b2116",
        "lineHeight": 1.38,
        "letterSpacing": 0.0,
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-b-card",
      "type": "shape",
      "x": 960.0,
      "y": 1150.0,
      "width": 500.0,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "rotation": 0.0,
      "content": "",
      "shapeData": {
        "kind": "rectangle",
        "fill": "#f7edcf",
        "stroke": "#b89b68",
