      "x": 960.0,
      "y": 1150.0,
      "width": 440.0,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "rotation": 0.0,
      "content": "**A WARNING**\n### Hubris crouches at the door\n- Danger: \"studying culture makes me see further\"\n- \"Everything is just culture\" defeats itself: that claim is cultural too\n- We stand by **grace alone** (Eph 2:8–10)",
      "textStyle": {
        "size": 17.0,
        "weight": 400.0,
