      "scale": 0.65,
      "rotation": 0.0,
      "content": "## Sources\n- *The Holy Bible, English Standard Version*: Gen 1:26–28; 9:1–7; Exod 3:14; 12:35–36; 20:2–3; Isa 45:5; Matt 10:16; Rom 1:18–21; Eph 2:8–10; 1 Pet 3:15; 1 John 3:4.\n- Trueman, C. R. (2020). *The rise and triumph of the modern self*. Crossway.\n- Bavinck, H. (2004). *Reformed dogmatics: Vol. 2. God and creation* (J. Bolt, Ed.; J. Vriend, Trans.). Baker Academic.\n- Van Til, C. (1972). *Common grace and the gospel*. Presbyterian and Reformed.",
